"in form"
msgstr "Eén van de velden \"%(other_field)s\" of \"%(field)s\" moet worden ingevuld"

#: application/forms.py:104 application/forms.py:115 application/forms.py:130
#: application/forms.py:480 application/forms.py:491 application/forms.py:506
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3197
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3268
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3300
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Naam"

#: application/forms.py:104 application/forms.py:480
msgid "Your first and last name."
msgstr "Jouw voornaam en achternaam."

#: application/forms.py:105 application/forms.py:118 application/forms.py:134
#: application/forms.py:481 application/forms.py:494 application/forms.py:510
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3201
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3259
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3325
msgid "Organisation name"
msgstr "Organisatie naam"

#: application/forms.py:106 application/forms.py:482
msgid "The name of the organisation you are affiliated with."
msgstr "De naam van de organisatie waaraan je verbonden bent."

#: application/forms.py:107 application/forms.py:124 application/forms.py:137
#: application/forms.py:483 application/forms.py:500 application/forms.py:513
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3228
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3272
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3329
msgid "Email address"
msgstr "E-mailadres"

#: application/forms.py:108 application/forms.py:484
msgid ""
"This email address may serve as a point of contact for LTER-LIFE in case "
"there are questions about the metadata form you are currently submitting."
" NB: by providing this email address, you give consent to LTER-LIFE to "
"display the email address on the LTER-NL Data Registry."
msgstr ""
"Dit e-mailadres kan worden gebruikt in het geval dat de administrators "
"van de LTER-NL Data Registry vragen hebben over het formulier wat je op "
"dit moment invult. NB: door dit emailadres in te vullen, geef je "
"toestemming aan LTER-LIFE om het emailadres te tonen op de LTER-NL Data "
"Registry."

#: application/forms.py:116 application/forms.py:492
msgid ""
"If the creator of the dataset is a person, please provide their first and"
" last name."
msgstr ""
"Als de vervaardiger van de dataset een persoon is, vul dan a.u.b. hun "
"voornaam en achternaam in."

#: application/forms.py:119 application/forms.py:495
msgid ""
"If the creator of the dataset is an organisation, provide the name of the"
" organisation here. If the creator of the dataset is a person, provide "
"the name of the organisation they are affiliated with."
msgstr ""
"Als de vervaardiger van de dataset een organisatie is, vul dan hier de "
"naam van de organisatie in. Als de vervaardiger van de dataset een "
"persoon is, vul dan de naam van de organisatie in waarmee die verbonden "
"is."

#: application/forms.py:124 application/forms.py:500
msgid ""
"If the creator of the dataset is a person, please provide their email "
"address. NB: by providing this email address, you give consent to LTER-"
"LIFE to display the email address on the LTER-NL Data Registry."
msgstr ""
"Als de vervaardiger van de dataset een persoon is, vul dan a.u.b. hun "
"e-mailadres in. NB: door dit e-mailadres in te vullen, geef je "
"toestemming aan LTER-LIFE om het e-mailadres te tonen op de LTER-NL Data "
"Registry."

#: application/forms.py:131 application/forms.py:507
msgid ""
"If the contact point of the dataset is a person, please provide their "
"first and last name. If the contact point of the dataset is a position, "
"please provide their role."
msgstr ""
"Als het contactpunt van de dataset een persoon is, vul dan a.u.b. hun "
"voornaamen achternaam in. Als het contactpunt een rol is, de naam van die"
" rol."

#: application/forms.py:135 application/forms.py:511
msgid "The name of the organisation the contact point is affiliated with."
msgstr "De naam van de organisatie waaraan het contactpunt is verbonden."

#: application/forms.py:138 application/forms.py:514
msgid ""
"This email address may serve as a point of contact for users of the LTER-"
"NL Data Registry in case they have questions about the dataset. NB: by "
"providing this email address, you give consent to LTER-LIFE to display "
"the email address on the LTER-NL Data Registry."
msgstr ""
"Dit e-mailadres kan dienen als een contact voor gebruikers van de LTER-NL"
" Data Registry voor het geval dat zij vragen hebben over de dataset. NB: "
"door dit e-mailadres in te vullen, geef je toestemming aan LTER-LIFE om "
"het e-mailadres te tonen op de LTER-NL Data Registry."

#: application/forms.py:144 application/forms.py:520
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3334
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Titel"

#: application/forms.py:144 application/forms.py:520
msgid ""
"A brief description of the dataset. Recommended to include: subject, "
"location, time period."
msgstr ""
"Een korte omschrijving van de dataset. Het wordt aanbevolen om het "
"onderwerp, de locatie en de tijdsperiode in de titel op te nemen."

#: application/forms.py:147 application/forms.py:523
#: application/templates/dataset_detail.html:22
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3357
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beschrijving"

#: application/forms.py:148 application/forms.py:524
msgid ""
"A description of the contents of the dataset. The description will be "
"used by full-text searches, and it should be rich with descriptive text. "
"Multiple paragraphs may be included. It should contain enough information"
" to allow potential data users to understand the data and decide on its "
"fitness for use. In particular, descriptions should include information "
"that does not fit into structured metadata, and focus on the “what”, "
"“when”, and “where” information, general taxonomic information, as well "
"as whether the data package is ongoing or completed. Some general methods"
" description is appropriate, and broad classes of measured parameters "
"should also be included."
msgstr ""
"Een gedetailleerde beschrijving van de inhoud van de dataset. Deze "
"beschrijving wordt gebruikt in de zoekfunctie van de LTER-NL Data "
"Registry en dient daarom een rijke beschrijving te zijn. Het is "
"toegestaan meerdere paragrafen op te nemen. De beschrijving moet "
"voldoende informatie bevatten zodat mogelijke data gebruikers de data "
"kunnen begrijpen en de geschiktheid van de dataset kunnen inschatten. "
"Specifiek dient de beschrijving de aandacht te leggen op welke data is "
"verzameld, waar en wanneer. Een algemene beschrijving van de methoden van"
" dataverzameling en gemeten variabelen wordt aanbevolen."

#: application/forms.py:159 application/forms.py:535
#: application/templates/dataset_detail.html:77
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3370
msgid "Keywords"
msgstr "Trefwoorden"

#: application/forms.py:159 application/forms.py:535
msgid ""
"Commonly used words or phrases to describe the dataset. Format: separate "
"keywords by a comma."
msgstr ""
"Trefwoorden zijn algemeen gebruikte kernwoorden om een dataset te "
"beschrijven. Format: scheid trefwoorden door een komma."

#: application/forms.py:164 application/forms.py:540
#: application/templates/dataset_detail.html:82
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3413
msgid "Resource type"
msgstr "Type"

#: application/forms.py:165 application/forms.py:541
msgid ""
"The nature of the dataset. Examples include but are not limited to: "
"observational data, experimental data, remotely sensed data, sounds, "
"images."
msgstr ""
"Het type of de soort data die verzameld zijn. Bijvoorbeeld: experimentele"
" data, genomische data, geospatiale data, observatiedata, simulatiedata, "
"onderzoeksdata, afbeelding, geluid."

#: application/forms.py:169 application/forms.py:545
#: application/templates/dataset_detail.html:114
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3440
msgid "License"
msgstr "Licentie"

#: application/forms.py:169 application/forms.py:545
msgid ""
"The license determines what rights may be available to users when using "
"the dataset. Recommend to choose one of the Creative Commons licenses. "
"Examples include but are not limited to: CC0, CC-BY, CC-BY-NC. Please see"
" https://creativecommons.org/share-your-work/cclicenses/ for more "
"Creative Commons licenses."
msgstr ""
"De licentie bepaalt welke rechten er rusten op een dataset. Het wordt "
"aanbevolen om één van de Creative Commons licenties te kiezen, "
"bijvoorbeeld: CC0, CC-BY, CC-BY-NC. Zie  https://creativecommons.org"
"/share-your-work/cclicenses/ voor meer Creative Commons licenties."

#: application/forms.py:175 application/forms.py:551
#: application/templates/dataset_detail.html:119
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3469
msgid "Access rights"
msgstr "Toegangsrechten"

#: application/forms.py:177 application/forms.py:552
msgid ""
"Information that indicates how the dataset can be accessed. Recommended "
"to choose one of: embargoed access, metadata only access, open access, "
"restricted access. For definitions of these terms, check: "
"https://vocabularies.coar-repositories.org/access_rights/."
msgstr ""
"De toegangsrechten geven de toegankelijkheid van de dataset aan. Het "
"wordt aanbevolen om een van de volgende te kiezen: onder embargo, toegang"
" beperkt tot metadata, vrij toegankelijk, beperkt toegankelijk. Voor meer"
" informatie zie: https://vocabularies.coar-"
"repositories.org/access_rights/."

#: application/forms.py:182 application/forms.py:557
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3495
msgid "Publisher name"
msgstr "Uitgever"

#: application/forms.py:183 application/forms.py:558
msgid ""
"The organisation that made a citable version of the dataset available "
"online. Examples include but are not limited to: GBIF, Dataverse NL, "
"Zenodo, Dryad, Figshare."
msgstr ""
"De naam van de uitgever of de naam van de organisatie die een citeerbare "
"versie van de dataset beschikbaar heeft gemaakt. Bijvoorbeeld: GBIF, "
"Dataverse NL, Zenodo, Dryad, Figshare."

#: application/forms.py:187 application/forms.py:562
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3523
msgid "Dataset ID"
msgstr "Dataset ID"

#: application/forms.py:187 application/forms.py:562
msgid "DOI or other unique identifier associated with the published dataset."
msgstr ""
"DOI of een andere unieke identificatie voor een dataset verstrekt door "
"een uitgever."

#: application/forms.py:191 application/forms.py:566
#: application/templates/dataset_detail.html:134
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3544
msgid "Landing page"
msgstr "Landingspagina"

#: application/forms.py:191 application/forms.py:566
msgid ""
"The web page (URL) that can be navigated to in a web browser to gain "
"access to the dataset."
msgstr ""
"De landingspagina is de webpagina (URL) waar een gebruiker naartoe kan "
"navigeren om toegang te krijgen tot een dataset."

#: application/forms.py:195 application/forms.py:570
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3569
msgid "Start date"
msgstr "Startdatum"

#: application/forms.py:196 application/forms.py:571
msgid ""
"The period of time when the data collection started. Format: either YYYY "
"or YYYY-MM-DD."
msgstr ""
"De tijd wanneer de dataverzameling gestart is. Format: een viercijferig "
"jaar (YYYY) of een volledige datum (YYYY-MM-DD)."

#: application/forms.py:198 application/forms.py:573
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3586
msgid "End date"
msgstr "Einddatum"

#: application/forms.py:199 application/forms.py:574
msgid ""
"The period of time when the data collection ended. NB: If data collection"
" is ongoing, leave empty or select the latest period of time that is "
"included in the current version of the dataset (format: either YYYY or "
"YYYY-MM-DD)."
msgstr ""
"Het moment wanneer de dataverzameling geëindigd is. Als de "
"dataverzameling nog gaande is, kun je de laatste datum in de huidige "
"versie van de dataset als einddatum gebruiken of dit veld open laten. "
"Format: een viercijferig jaar (YYYY) of een volledige datum (YYYY-MM-DD)."

#: application/forms.py:204 application/forms.py:579
#: application/templates/dataset_detail.html:109
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3607
msgid "Temporal resolution"
msgstr "Tijdresolutie"

#: application/forms.py:205 application/forms.py:580
msgid ""
"The temporal resolution of the dataset is the minimum temporal separation"
" between records in the dataset."
msgstr ""
"De tijdresolutie is de minimale afstand in tijd tussen twee records in de"
" dataset."

#: application/forms.py:208 application/forms.py:583
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3625
msgid "Spatial coverage"
msgstr "Ruimtelijke dekking"

#: application/forms.py:209 application/forms.py:584
msgid ""
"The spatial extent that is covered by the dataset. Use the interactive "
"map to draw the study area of your dataset."
msgstr ""
"Het geografische gebied waarop de dataset betrekking heeft. Gebruik de "
"interactieve kaart om het studiegebied van jouw dataset in te tekenen."

#: application/forms.py:212 application/forms.py:587
msgid "Spatial coverage from file"
msgstr "Ruimtelijke dekking op basis van een bestand"

#: application/forms.py:213 application/forms.py:588
msgid ""
"The spatial extent that is covered by the dataset. Upload a zip file "
"containing the 4 files that make up a shapefile (i.e., .shp, .shx, .dbf, "
".prj)."
msgstr ""
"Het geografische gebied waarop de dataset betrekking heeft. Upload een "
"zipbestand met daarin de 4 bestanden die samen een shapefile maken "
"(d.w.z., .shp, .shx, .dbf, .prj)."

#: application/forms.py:217 application/forms.py:592
#: application/templates/dataset_detail.html:87
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3666
msgid "Spatial resolution"
msgstr "Ruimtelijke resolutie"

#: application/forms.py:217 application/forms.py:592
msgid ""
"If the dataset contains data acquired over a range of spatial locations "
"during each collection period, document the minimum spatial separation "
"between records in the dataset."
msgstr ""
"Als de dataset meerdere locaties bevat gedurende een verzamelperiode, "
"noteer dan de minimale ruimtelijke resolutie tussen records in de "
"dataset."

#: application/forms.py:223 application/forms.py:598
#: application/templates/dataset_detail.html:92
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3696
msgid "Taxonomic coverage"
msgstr "Taxonomische dekking"

#: application/forms.py:223 application/forms.py:598
msgid ""
"If applicable, taxonomic coverage is a description of the taxa "
"represented in the dataset. May be as generic as 'small passerines' or as"
" specific as listing taxon names."
msgstr ""
"Indien van toepassing, de taxonomische dekking is de beschrijving van de "
"biologische taxa die de dataset omvat. Dit kan variëren van een generieke"
" omschrijving zoals 'kleine zangvogels' tot het beschrijven van een lijst"
" met soorten."

#: application/forms.py:229 application/forms.py:604
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3156
msgid "Metadata submission date"
msgstr "Registratiedatum"

#: application/forms.py:229 application/forms.py:604
msgid "Date of registration of your dataset in the LTER-NL Data Registry."
msgstr ""
"De datum waarop de dataset in de LTER-NL Data Registry geregistreerd "
"wordt."

#: application/forms.py:232 application/forms.py:607
#: application/templates/instructions.html:3165
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Taal"

#: application/forms.py:233 application/forms.py:608
msgid "Language used in this form"
msgstr "De taal waarin het formulier ingevuld wordt."

#: application/forms.py:235 application/forms.py:610
msgid "Terms and conditions"
msgstr "Voorwaarden"

#: application/forms.py:235 application/forms.py:610
msgid "Yes, I have read and agree to the terms and conditions."
msgstr "Ja, ik heb de voorwaarden gelezen en ik ga hiermee akkoord."

#: application/forms.py:236 application/forms.py:611
msgid "Please answer Yes to proceed"
msgstr "Antwoord 'Ja' om door te gaan"

#: application/forms.py:241 application/forms.py:616
msgid "Submit dataset"
msgstr "Dien dataset in"

#: application/forms.py:401
msgid "Paste dataset URL here..."
msgstr "Plak hier de dataset URL..."

#: application/routes.py:170 application/routes.py:230
msgid "Register your dataset"
msgstr "Registreer jouw dataset"

#: application/routes.py:185
msgid "Invalid form"
msgstr "Ongeldig formulier"

#: application/routes.py:215
msgid "LLM Prefilled dataset"
msgstr "Vooraf ingevulde dataset door de LLM"

#: application/routes.py:308
msgid "Your download list"
msgstr "Jouw download lijst"

#: application/routes.py:321
#, python-format
msgid "Dataset \"%(title)s\" added to the %(link_start)sDownload list%(link_end)s"
msgstr ""
"Dataset \"%(title)s\" toegevoegd aan de %(link_start)sDownload "
